# Generated at build time by scripts/fetch-github.mjs, so it is not committed.
# Regenerating needs GITHUB_TOKEN (set in the Vercel project env, and in .env
# locally). The script exits 0 without writing when the token is absent, so a
# build with no token SUCCEEDS but ships no file and the contributions graph
# falls back to its error state — check this first if that graph goes blank.
#
# Note the other generated artifacts are deliberately NOT ignored:
# public/{apple-touch-icon,icon-192,icon-512}.png + site.webmanifest, and
# src/assets/optimized/*. Those are committed because the build depends on
# them being present — generate-icons.mjs fails hard if the icons are missing,
# and the optimized webp files are imported directly by components.
public/github-contributions.json

# Playwright MCP session scratch (page snapshots, console logs, screenshots).
.playwright-mcp/

